      "text": "The scarcest human resource is full-hearted commitment.\n\nWhat could you accomplish if you committed headfirst, w/no exit strategy, into a critical mission for the next 10 years?\n\nThe answer is exponentially more than if you’re half-in-half-out.\n\nDreams die in the zone of “maybe”.",
