      },
      "text": "“Pentagon’s AI Chief says data labeling is key to win race with China”\n\nPer @DODCDAO, we will win through data supremacy. AI boils down to data (and compute)—this is the fundamental lesson of the past decade of AI advancements.\n\nhttps://t.co/ek88kgXlRd",
