        "quote_count": 24,
        "reply_count": 75,
        "retweet_count": 128
      },
      "text": "I’m seeing many fall into the “self-driving trap” w/Gen AI\n\nThe self-driving trap is seeing shiny demos &amp; thinking said demos will reach 100% reliability for prod w/in a few years\n\nMany proposed Gen AI use cases need 100% reliability, and thinking that’ll come soon is a mistake",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1617654992214843392"
