      "text": "I turned 26 this week🥳\n\nEvery year, I more deeply appreciate wisdom &amp; mastery\n\nYouth is energy &amp; a willingness to brute force anything. With wisdom, you learn to be one with nature—push smarter\n\nThe ideal is a mix of both—the energy of a young bull w/the knowing eye of a master",
