      "text": "Some days you make 20x the progress of your average day.\n\nIt’s elusive—I don’t know of hacks to make every day a 20x day.\n\nThe randomness of 20x days is at the core of the virtue of perseverance—keep at it and you’ll have enough 20x days.\n\nAnd boy, does it feel good 🥳",
