      "text": "Maker vs manager diets:\n\nNo caffeine is optimal for managers—since halting my caffeine consumption, I’ve noticed calmer, more consistent thought processes.\n\nBut, caffeine is KEY for makers—one caffeine-fueled night of coding can make up 90% of your weekly output.",
