      "text": "coding vs writing (my two favorite activities)\n\nCoding is about correctness.\nWriting is about intrigue.\n\nIn coding, 80% of effort is debugging something that almost-but-not-quite works\n\nIn writing, 80% of effort is to create prose and plot so punchy they cannot be ignored",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1614674755155542017"
