        "impression_count": 33786,
        "like_count": 157,
        "quote_count": 2,
        "reply_count": 10,
        "retweet_count": 26
      },
      "text": "At @scale_AI, we built AI to predict damage in Ukraine from Russian missiles.\n\nThis is a small glimmer, but undeniably future wars will be fought with AI.\n\nNo exaggeration—our adoption of AI for national security will define the future of our world.\n\nhttps://t.co/F3D9wd6v2m",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1613978103310868480"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2023-01-06T22:03:33.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
