        "impression_count": 369621,
        "like_count": 2251,
        "quote_count": 27,
        "reply_count": 85,
        "retweet_count": 249
      },
      "text": "The greatest luxury in life is being in an environment where your only responsibility is to learn\n\nThis might sound like college, but college is not a place to learn most useful things\n\nThe sweet spot is apprenticeship in a dynamic environment—a hypergrowth startup for example",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1611483635135447040"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2023-01-05T17:29:18.000Z",
