        "like_count": 45,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 3
      },
      "text": "Note—we support experts along a wide variety of axes:\n- English/writing\n- math\n- coding\n- law\n- medicine\n\nYou name it, we've probably done it and can quickly scale up an expert rater pool!",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1611052229502586880"
