      "text": "We're seeing an explosion of interest for RLHF &amp; chat labeling @scale_AI 💥\n\nThe core differentiator between GPT-3 and ChatGPT is RLHF—experts who taught the model conversation &amp; niche topics like coding.\n\nIf you need expert raters, email us at language-models@scale.com",
