      "text": "We're hosting a Generative AI &amp; LLM hackathon at @scale_AI HQ in SF on 1/21.\n\nThere will be:\n🏆 prizes (Napa tour, skydiving, drones)\n🏤 workshops (Advanced Prompt Engineering with @goodside)\n🧑‍⚖️ judges like @karpathy\n\nApplication link below—come build something cool❗️",
