      "text": "We’re currently watching the previously impervious-seeming tech giants being meaningfully threatened, moats be damned:\n\n- Meta by TikTok\n- Google by ChatGPT\n\nThe march of technology and consumer habits shows no mercy.\n\nThe only true moat is velocity and customer obsession.",
